WEBVTT

00:01:27.076 --> 00:01:31.516
if compost believes in life

00:01:31.516 --> 00:01:33.076
after death

00:01:33.516 --> 00:01:39.356
I wonder if breath ever thinks of suicide

00:01:39.756 --> 00:01:43.156
if the wind just wants to sit

00:01:43.156 --> 00:01:45.316
still sometimes

00:01:45.436 --> 00:01:47.916
and watch the world pass him by

00:01:48.076 --> 00:01:49.836
if smoke was born

00:01:49.836 --> 00:01:52.156
knowing how to rise

00:01:52.316 --> 00:01:56.276
if rainbows get shy backstage

00:01:56.516 --> 00:02:00.276
not sure if their colors match right